{
    "title": "Heymandi Make Friends by Words",
    "description": "\ud83d\udd25What you say is who you are. Match with a new friend in NO time.\ud83d\udd25\r\n \r\n\r\n\u2022 Indulge in an image-free world with your heart and inner self \u2764\ufe0f\r\n\u2022 Stay Private  \ud83d\udd12\r\n\u2022 Show your gender optionally. Find the right person  \ud83c\udfad\r\n\u2022 Connect others with specific topics through tags #\ufe0f\u20e3\r\n\u2022 Build trust with words. Exchange disappearing photos fairly. \ud83d\udcf7\r\n\u2022 Find out who is nearby \ud83c\udf0e\r\n\r\n\r\nGET READY TO HEYMANDI?\r\n\r\nNo profile, No image, No burden. What you say is who you are.\ud83d\udcdd\r\nMeet new friends in seconds. Fast and mysterious.\r\n\r\n\r\nPOST. INVITE. CHAT. As simple as that.\r\n\r\nLooking for more features? \ud83c\udd99\r\nUpgrade to Hey Silver / Gold to enjoy your superpower.\r\n\r\n\r\nHey Gold\ud83c\udfc5\r\n\r\n10 Super Invites \ud83d\ude80  daily increases your chance of being accepted. Unlimited Conversations allows you to chat with more new friends at the same time. Accept missed invitations instantly, and remove ads that disturb you when you are chatting happily. Put on a fancy look \ud83c\udfc5 to enhance the attractiveness and the \u201cHey Gold Special\u201d send two invitations at a time as well as an exposure boost \ud83d\udd1d.\r\n\r\n\r\nHey Silver \ud83e\udd48\r\n\r\n5 Super Invites \ud83d\ude80  daily increases your chance of being accepted. Adding a maximum of 5 conversations allows you to chat with more new friends at the same time. Accept missed invitations instantly, and remove ads that disturb you when you are chatting happily. Put on a fancy look \ud83e\udd48 to enhance attractiveness.\r\n\r\n\r\nAd-Free \u26d4\ufe0f\r\n\r\nRemove ads that disturb you when you are chatting happily\r\n\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you choose to purchase Hey Gold or Hey Silver or Ad-Free, payment will be charged to your Google Play Store account, and your account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours before the end of the current period. Auto-renewal may be turned off at any time by going to your settings in Google Play after purchase. The current Hey Gold subscription price is from $24.99 US/month, one-month, three-month, and six-month packages are available. The current Hey Silver subscription price is from $12.99 US/month, and one-month, three-month, and six-months packages are available. The current Ad-Free subscription price is from $2.99 US/month, and one-month, three-month, and three-month packages are available. Prices are in USD, may vary in countries other than the U.S., and are subject to change without notice. No cancellation of the current subscription is allowed during the active subscription period.\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you don\u2019t choose to purchase Hey Gold or Hey Silver or Ad-Free, you can simply continue using Heymandi for free.\r\n\r\n\r\nHeymandi Privacy Policy\r\n\r\nhttps://www.heymandi.com/terms/privacy\r\n\r\n\r\nHeymandi User Terms\r\n\r\nhttps://www.heymandi.com/terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83d\udd25What you say is who you are. Match with a new friend in NO time.\ud83d\udd25<br> <br><br>\u2022 Indulge in an image-free world with your heart and inner self \u2764\ufe0f<br>\u2022 Stay Private  \ud83d\udd12<br>\u2022 Show your gender optionally. Find the right person  \ud83c\udfad<br>\u2022 Connect others with specific topics through tags #\ufe0f\u20e3<br>\u2022 Build trust with words. Exchange disappearing photos fairly. \ud83d\udcf7<br>\u2022 Find out who is nearby \ud83c\udf0e<br><br><br>GET READY TO HEYMANDI?<br><br>No profile, No image, No burden. What you say is who you are.\ud83d\udcdd<br>Meet new friends in seconds. Fast and mysterious.<br><br><br>POST. INVITE. CHAT. As simple as that.<br><br>Looking for more features? \ud83c\udd99<br>Upgrade to Hey Silver / Gold to enjoy your superpower.<br><br><br>Hey Gold\ud83c\udfc5<br><br>10 Super Invites \ud83d\ude80  daily increases your chance of being accepted. Unlimited Conversations allows you to chat with more new friends at the same time. Accept missed invitations instantly, and remove ads that disturb you when you are chatting happily. Put on a fancy look \ud83c\udfc5 to enhance the attractiveness and the \u201cHey Gold Special\u201d send two invitations at a time as well as an exposure boost \ud83d\udd1d.<br><br><br>Hey Silver \ud83e\udd48<br><br>5 Super Invites \ud83d\ude80  daily increases your chance of being accepted. Adding a maximum of 5 conversations allows you to chat with more new friends at the same time. Accept missed invitations instantly, and remove ads that disturb you when you are chatting happily. Put on a fancy look \ud83e\udd48 to enhance attractiveness.<br><br><br>Ad-Free \u26d4\ufe0f<br><br>Remove ads that disturb you when you are chatting happily<br><br><br>-----------------------------------<br><br><br>If you choose to purchase Hey Gold or Hey Silver or Ad-Free, payment will be charged to your Google Play Store account, and your account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours before the end of the current period. Auto-renewal may be turned off at any time by going to your settings in Google Play after purchase. The current Hey Gold subscription price is from $24.99 US/month, one-month, three-month, and six-month packages are available. The current Hey Silver subscription price is from $12.99 US/month, and one-month, three-month, and six-months packages are available. The current Ad-Free subscription price is from $2.99 US/month, and one-month, three-month, and three-month packages are available. Prices are in USD, may vary in countries other than the U.S., and are subject to change without notice. No cancellation of the current subscription is allowed during the active subscription period.<br><br><br>If you don\u2019t choose to purchase Hey Gold or Hey Silver or Ad-Free, you can simply continue using Heymandi for free.<br><br><br>Heymandi Privacy Policy<br><br>https://www.heymandi.com/terms/privacy<br><br><br>Heymandi User Terms<br><br>https://www.heymandi.com/terms",
